      "post_subject": "Does anyone have this paper?",
      "content_md": "Hi\n\nDoes anyone have access to this paper?\n\nFiber optic holography equipment and theory\n\nWilliam E. Durell - Durell Labs. (USA)\n\nI'm not sure but I believe it may be an extract from the Intl Symp on Display Holography, January 1992.\n\nSaxby makes reference to Durell with relation to Fiber Optics in Holography in his book and I would like to read the paper.\n\nI'm not trying to get the paper for nothing and I don't mind paying a reasonable fee for the paper if someone knows whereabouts I can download it easily.\n\nMany thanks\n\nJem",
